    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>d</mi></math> is the distance covered by aeroplane in <mml:math xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\" xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mml:mn><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math></mml:mn><mml:mi>&nbsp;</mml:mi><mml:mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mml:mi><mml:mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mml:mi><mml:mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mml:mi><mml:mo>.</mml:mo></mml:math><br /><br />Let, the height at which the plane is flying be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi></math><br /><br />In <math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math>,<br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math> ...(i)<br /><br />In <math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></math>,<br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathva